  "forMoves": {
    "_comment": [
      "docs/PLAN-EXERCISE.md, phase 3: a hold may be asked „for N moves\", and such a game,",
      "stopped at its move target, is judged by the position it reached. A WIN with a number is",
      "„checkmate in N moves\" (the owner's live pass, 19.9.2026): mate within N of the student's",
      "own moves or the goal is missed, judged by the rules alone — never a tablebase, and with",
      "any number of pieces. Kept under its own",
      "key so the ends that do not know the rule yet keep reading `cases` and `rejected`",
      "unchanged. `judged` is the pure half: when the game stops, and whether a tablebase",
      "can say what it reached (seven pieces or fewer). `byTablebase` is the verdict itself:",
      "`category` is the tablebase's word for the side TO MOVE in `fen`, and the student may",
      "be either side. Cursed wins and blessed losses are draws."
    ],
